# PQ-009: Competing anions share a limited barium budget
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 Na2SO4 0.0005mol
add v1 Na2CO3 0.0005mol
add v1 BaCl2 0.0004mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 Na2SO4 0.0005mol
add v2 Na2CO3 0.0005mol
add v2 BaCl2 0.0008mol
inspect
